WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.630
The girls in fashion these days,
Kono goro hayari no onna no ko

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.760
Are the girls with small butts.
Oshiri no chiisana onna no ko

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:12.900
Turn this way, Honey!
Kocchi wo muite yo hanii

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:17.040
But somehow... But, but, it's a little bit...
Datte nanda ka datte datte nanda mon

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:24.880
Please! Please! Don 't hurt me.
Onegai! Onegai! Kizutsuke naide

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.410
My heart is...
Watashi no haato wa

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.720
Oh no, it's pounding!
Chuku chuku shichau no

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:36.190
Please don't stare, please!
Iya yo, iya yo, iya yo mitsumecha iyaa

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.200
Honey Flash!

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.180
The popular girls these days,
Imadoki ninki no onna no ko

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.240
Are bouncy and buxom girls.
Pukutto boin no onna no ko

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.350
Turn this way, Honey!
Kocchi wo muite yo hanni

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:03.790
But somehow... But, but, it's a little bit...
Datte nanda ka datte datte nanda mon

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:11.260
Please! Please! Don't come near!
Onegai! Onegai! Chikayora naide

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.860
My nose...
Watashi no ohana ga

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:18.130
Oh, no! It's twitching!
Hiku Hiku shichau no

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.630
Please don't stare, please!
Iya yo, iya yo, iya yo mitsumecha iyaa

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.580
Honey Flash!

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:28.810
I'm going to transform!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:34.260
Mini-skirt Bar
Sweet Honey

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.220
Finally, what you've all been waiting for!

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:41.090
Our club's speciality!
It's time to start Dancing Time!

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.120
Please enjoy!

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:55.770
All right! This is great!

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:12.490
What is this?!
We don't do cosplay here!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.690
I'm over here.

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.360
Come to me, Honey-san.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.530
My... my club!
Who the hell are you people?!

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.630
Out of the way!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.630
Honey Boomerang!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.370
Oops...

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.930
My club...

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.880
Why don't you give yourself up?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.220
How wonderful!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.320
When you fight,
you're so beautiful.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:58.660
I get excited when people
chase after me like this.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.330
If you're admiring me, thanks...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.400
I don't need your lip service.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.370
I'm going to take
every last bit of you!

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:35.540
You two! Put down your
weapons and come out quietly!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.230
Look... Na-chan's angry again...

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.800
Let's stop.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.370
You mustn't say such
weak words, Honey-san.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.740
You're a woman that I,
Cobalt Claw, have acknowledged.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:50.710
Use your power until
you've reached your limit!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.220
You two are completely surrounded!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.320
Surrender quietly!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.090
Isn't that impossible?

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:12.300
Now the fun begins, my sweet Honey.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.180
So, those weren't mere decorations!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.580
How stupid.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:29.850
Accessories are a woman's
true weapons. Please, study harder.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.760
I like to study
after I've gone home...

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.460
— Why is she losing, that idiot?!
— What should we do?

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.190
— Isn't it obvious? Apprehend them!
— Apprehend...

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.630
Both of them?

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.200
Anyway, if we don't
stop those two...

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:46.200
Tokyo will be trashed.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.610
What's that?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.020
Up there!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.760
Next, blow up the right side
over there with a bang!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.320
Zooka!
I'm shooting, Zooka!

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.890
Wow, wonderful! That's great.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:20.600
Now, the other side.
With the feeling of fire, I guess!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:25.770
Sky sky... Carpet Bombing!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.050
Another weirdo...

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:34.080
This is too much for the police.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.280
Shall we call the Self Defense Force?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.520
Idiot! Don't just stare...
hurry up and go!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.790
— Go where?
— Go arrest her!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.760
— No way!
— What about here?

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.930
I'll handle it.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.130
What a beautiful expression.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.970
Pain is certainly an
important kind of pleasure.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:58.440
I'll send you to ecstasy this time.
It's okay for you to scream.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.280
Your voice is as
beautiful as I imagined.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.820
But... we're not done yet!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.560
You shouldn't resist, Honey-san.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.660
With a much, much...

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:25.400
more beautiful voice!
Send my soul to outer space!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.820
Na-chan! You saved me?!

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.620
Idiot! Why are you struggling
against that kind of an opponent?!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.320
What I want sent flying is my soul.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:48.430
Nobody asked you
to send my body flying!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.330
Na-chan!

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:56.330
This is why I hate
unsophisticated women!

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:00.700
Honey! Na-chan! I'll save you!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.840
I hate men even more!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.610
Also, I only face one
opponent at a time.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:17.020
I won't forgive those whose interfere,
no matter who they are!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.050
Na-chan!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.950
Honey Flash!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.210
Na-chan, are you okay?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:41.240
Don't mind me!
Hurry up and finish her!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:47.580
You are completely surrounded!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.820
Put down your weapons
and surrender quietly!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.300
Another weirdo!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.600
Having a hard time?

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:13.070
— Children should stay out of this!
— I'm already done with my business.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:16.380
But I thought Jill-sama might be sad
if I returned without helping you.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:20.450
Even though it might not seem
like it, Jill-sama really likes Cobalt.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:24.680
I'll be in trouble if you're defeated!

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:29.190
"The harder the battle, the more pleasure victory brings" is what they say.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.600
Yes, yes.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:36.400
Honey-san. Love gets better
the second time around.

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.400
Hey! Don't let them get away!
Capture them!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:40.670
Oh, right.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.970
See ya!

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.240
So pretty!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.180
Idiot! Now is not the time for that!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.450
Bye!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.620
They're gone.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.860
What're you going to do?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.830
I can't help it... they disappeared.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.420
I'm not talking about that!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:14.260
I was just trying to catch them...

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.470
I'm telling you to keep in mind
where you're fighting.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.370
Even in television hero series,

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:22.440
the battles are in deserted mountains
or construction sites, right?

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.420
Really?

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:26.390
Jeez. At least think about how
much trouble you're causing others.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.790
— But...
— No buts!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:32.990
Now, now. Don't get so angry.
Honey's trying her best, Na-chan.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.650
I told you not to call me Na-chan!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:40.430
But still, Na-chan... you came to
save me, didn't you? I was so happy!

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:45.060
Don't misunderstand me! I was just
trying to do something about you two.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:49.600
Anyway! If this continues,
I really will take you in!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:58.280
Don't worry. She's not serious.
That's how Na-chan expresses her love.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.650
I wonder...

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:06.120
What exactly is Panther Claw's goal?

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.920
I don't think this
destruction is meaningless.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.400
I wonder...
Panther Claw Provisional
Countermeasure Headquarters

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:16.170
Wasn't the Police Headquarters
attack from before just a ruckus?

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.500
If we don't know their goal,
we can't plan a countermeasure!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.440
If that's the case, why was a
Countermeasure Headquarters created

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:26.040
despite the objections from above?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:31.180
If you don't want to do it, get out!
I have plenty of replacements!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.640
— N-no!
— This seems to have been their purpose.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:36.150
What's this?

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.380
This was all... they were after?

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.380
Honey baka

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:55.210
I'm so happy Jill-sama
likes it this much!

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.770
Scarlet-sama, you're as
good as ever. Splendid work.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.480
Please, please. It's all thanks to
Cobalt's hard work. isn't it, Cobalt?

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.350
Are you trying to lesson the importance
of my fight with honey, Scarlet?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:12.220
That's absurd! I'm so scared; there's no
way I'd take on a violent opponent like her.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.220
I've been thanking you repeatedly,
thinking, "Cobalt's so good! "

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:19.190
Of course. You're not good
enough to be her opponent yet,

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.400
since doing something foolish is all you can
do to make Jill-sama pay attention to you!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.200
Oh my. Wasn't it a bit unwise
for you to say that?

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:28.610
What do you mean?

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.270
If you're going to say
what I did was foolish,

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:35.940
then Jill-sama is also foolish for
being happy with it. Isn't that so?

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:38.210
Isn't that unwise?

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:41.720
Cobalt-sama, please be careful.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.320
Anyway!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.090
If you interfere with my fight with
Honey-san again, I won't forgive you!

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.830
What are you thinking?

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.530
It's a secret! But maybe
I can tell you just a little bit...

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.530
Thank you.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.670
I thought I'd give
Jill-sama what she wants.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:07.940
Have you found out
what Jill-sama wants?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.390
Just a bit... Right, Jill-sama?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:15.220
Shinjuku Big Destruction!!
What is the secret organization's goal?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.830
The aim of the secret organization, Panther Claw,

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.890
seems to have been to make a fool out of Cutie Honey!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.360
The investigators cannot hide their bewilderment

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.160
at what appears to be a highly trivial

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:29.190
purpose for destroying the city!

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:34.000
What? The city was damaged
because of what's-her-face Honey?

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:37.500
But Panther Claw are the
ones to blame, aren't they?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.810
Isn't what's-her-face Honey
also a badger like them?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.380
— Badger?
— Huh? You were here the whole time, Kisaragi-san?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.320
I wasn't late today!

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:46.980
My, is that so?

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.080
I didn't notice since you don't make much
of a difference whether you're here or not.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.530
And? What's this badger?

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:55.690
Raccoon dog, a raccoon dog!
You didn't know that?

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.820
Raccoon dog? You mean Honey?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.290
It means that they're nuisances to us.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.030
Both Panther-whatchamacallit
and what's-her-face Honey!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.000
— Nuisances...
— Of course!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:09.800
Honey, or whatever she's called...

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:13.250
Troublesome people like her
should be dealt with quickly.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.550
Otherwise, I can't even
touch women's breasts!

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:17.210
Huh? Breasts?

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:20.590
I mean...! Anyway, she's troublesome
to the thousandth degree!

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.220
That Honey what's-her-face!

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:25.680
Now that I think about it; your name's
also Honey, isn't it, Kisaragi-san?

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.750
Really... what a bothersome
person, that Honey.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.600
All of you should get back to work!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.830
You heard him, Kisaragi-san. Instead of
eating all the time, do some work!

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:41.070
Even if you're not late, it's pointless
unless you do some work. Jeez!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.070
Okay...

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.310
Destroyed quite splendidly!

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:55.750
There'll probably be more cleaning
to do because of all that.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:56.880
Granny.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:00.450
Oh my, I'm always thinking about work.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.590
It really is a problem.
It must be tough for you.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.790
Nope. This is nothing.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:12.300
I'm feeling very motivated right now.
My cleaning spirit is on fire, I guess.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:19.040
I'm thankful that I have something
to do while I can still move about.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.610
If you don't think like that,
you can't work.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:25.350
Something I can do, huh?
You're so positive, Granny.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.920
Working overtime again?
Shall I make you some rice balls?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.120
Thank you.

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:34.760
But I'll pass for today. There's
someone I want to eat dinner with.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.290
My... you've found someone?

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.990
Yes, a friend.

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.560
I made a friend.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.160
Is that so? Good for you.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:57.180
In the end, Honey's existence creates
a bigger disturbance, doesn't it?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.950
But, in order to stop Panther
Claw's destructive actions...

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.550
The fact is, we need Honey's power!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.120
Are you saying that with
our country's police force,

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.790
we cannot stop
Panther Claw's activities?

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.230
No, but Honey is necessary
to fight against Panther Claw!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:18.730
But you cannot deny the fact that when
Honey appears, the destruction increases!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.300
If disturbances like these continue,

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.870
the citizens' discontent will be
aimed at us, the police.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.010
So I promise this won't happen again...

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:31.610
Do you have the power to stop it?

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:36.390
— Well...
— Isn't Honey's existence itself the problem?

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.520
What do you mean?

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.830
In other words, if Honey didn't exist,
Panther Claw's activities would cease.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.490
Isn't that so?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.430
If that is the case,
what are you suggesting I do?

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:51.170
Figuring that out should be a job
for the person who went over us...

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.160
and made the Countermeasure
Headquarters to stop Panther Claw.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:57.200
Don't ever let something
like this happen again.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.510
That's all we want.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:01.640
We're counting on you, Aki-kun.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:07.720
My, my. I guess they're planning to just
watch, since it's out of their hands.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:10.450
The State's authority is pathetic.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:10.820
Is Honey evil or just?
Maichou Newspaper

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.050
But,

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.550
Panther Claw's target is Cutie Honey!!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:18.160
this disturbance won't
be subdued like this.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:25.140
So... that Honey just has to disappear, right?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.270
Yes, yes. That's right.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.740
I don't think Honey's bad.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.870
— Why?
— 'Cause she's cute, right?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:36.010
That's why people say
you have no taste in women.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:40.850
That's the kind of woman who has a bad
personality. I think the real evil is Honey.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:42.380
That's right, that's right.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:47.290
It's low, but effective.
What will you do, Honey?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.590
<i>It means that they're nuisances to us.</i>

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.300
<i>Both Panther-whatchamacallit
and what's-her-face Honey!</i>

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:02.330
Nuisances... eh?

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:11.980
<i>Isn't Honey's existence itself the problem?</i>

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.620
Welcome home, Na-chan!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.110
Welcome home!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.790
Come in, come in!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.060
Hey...

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.090
Over here!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:29.300
I thought I'd eat this with you when
you got home, Na-chan, so I prepared it!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.940
— Did you make all of this?
— Yeah. Eat up!

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.140
You waited until now?

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.130
I ate a little bit of it...

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:41.580
But really, food tastes better when you eat it with someone and not all by yourself, doesn't it?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.990
I didn't know what you liked,
Na-chan, so I don't know if you like it.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.540
Just eat what you like, okay?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.650
Because if you leave stuff,
I'll eat all of it!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.490
Sit down!
Would you like some tea?

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.960
Or how about some beer?

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.000
I'm sorry.

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.200
I'm sorry, but I already ate.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.510
Oh, is that so? Then how
about just having some beer?

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:11.980
Don't do this!

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.680
We're not friends, we're nothing.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.250
We're not friends, we're nothing?

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.380
Yes, that's right.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.650
You understand, right?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.820
But, you saved me, didn't you?!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:38.740
Or... were you really trying to somehow
take care of the both of us back then?

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:44.340
Am I really a nuisance?

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.870
Answer me!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.480
You just might...

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.780
be one.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.890
Now then!

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.210
What happened?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.610
Zooka!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.920
Sky!

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.380
Ba-ba-bam!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.290
What kind of ruckus is it this time?

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:15.130
I'm sorry about yesterday. For saying
stuff to embarrass you in front of Jill-sama.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:17.600
I wasn't really embarrassed!

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:21.010
Acting strong again?
But Scarlet's really regretting it.

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:24.970
So I thought I'd call out
Cobalt's favourite Honey-chan.

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:26.840
Honey-san?

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.480
— You'll win this time, won't you?
— Of course!

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:35.490
Yes. I just sent you the situation.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.580
Now, now. Don't be so impatient.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:41.490
The "Ai-System " is evolving.
For now, the situation...

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.120
Huh? A blackout?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:52.570
They're putting on
quite a show again!

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:57.610
The phone's out, too. I guess
they're blocking radio waves as well.

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:01.000
It's no good.

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:05.250
Information coming in from the Shibuya precinct seems to have been completely cut off.

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:09.340
— Cell phone service is out too.
— The police radio's out too, isn't it?

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.430
I can't even get NHK.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:14.690
What exactly is starting
to happen in Shibuya?

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:17.980
Emergency Broadcast:
Where exactly is Cutie Honey?

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:25.110
Cutie Honey is at fault

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:26.860
Come out, Honey!

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:35.370
Girls that piss me off these days
Konogoro mukatsuku onna no ko

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:38.510
are air headed girls.
Otsumu no karui onna no ko

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:40.950
Come here, Honey...
Kocchi e oite yo hanii

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:41.820
Honey!

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:43.410
Cause it's a little bit!
Datte nanda ka!

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:46.020
It's a little bit annoying.
Chotto uzaidamon

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:49.760
Please! Please! Don't butt in.
Onegai! Onegai! Deshara naide

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.600
Who is she?

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:52.000
Please! Please! Don't butt in.
Onegai! Onegai! Deshara naide

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.600
Before, Odaiba. Next, Shibuya?

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:54.970
My heart is getting irritated!
Watashi no haato wa... ira ira shichau no

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:57.400
Those guys sure like being on television.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:57.500
My heart is getting irritated!
Watashi no haato wa... ira ira shichau no

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.700
They really crave the limelight.

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:05.580
Don't hide!
Iya yo, iya yo, iya yo Kakurecha iya

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:07.640
Scarlet Flash!

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:11.280
I'm going to destroy!

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:13.180
Zooka!

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:22.660
I'm sure the quicker ones among
you have already noticed.

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:25.960
But we're looking for Honey-chan!

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:31.030
And there was some information
saying she'd be in Shibuya.

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:34.530
So... please don't interfere
for a bit, okay?

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:37.640
What's with her disgusting
manner of speaking?!

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:41.640
Aren't you thinking she's cute?
What a stupid woman.

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:46.090
But... can't Honey
transform into anybody?

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:50.280
So, we don't know who Honey-chan is.

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:55.280
So, we though we had no choice but
to kill everybody who resembles her.

00:24:01.130 --> 00:24:03.830
Well, if you can't find Honey-chan,

00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:07.240
We'll have to increase the search area.

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:10.140
If they don't find her,
they're going to capture and kill

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:12.670
all the women in Japan...
No, I mean in the world!

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:14.010
They've really done it this time!

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:16.570
I really don't want to do this!

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:20.210
But isn't Honey-chan very strong?

00:24:20.220 --> 00:24:23.660
We can't help since we're scared!

00:24:23.660 --> 00:24:26.790
So, don't think poorly of us, okay?

00:24:26.790 --> 00:24:30.130
They're saying that whatever
happens, it's Honey's fault, huh?

00:24:30.130 --> 00:24:33.790
Do they think they can convince
people with such an illogical reason?

00:24:33.800 --> 00:24:36.060
It's not reasoning, it's an image.

00:24:36.070 --> 00:24:42.340
"Because Honey's constantly there,
isn't she the cause of this damage?"

00:24:42.340 --> 00:24:46.780
So the previous incident was to
reinforce that image of her, huh?

00:24:46.780 --> 00:24:50.310
— She's smart.
— That's how ignorant women do things.

00:24:50.580 --> 00:24:54.040
The more ignorant the woman,
the more she specializes in such methods.

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:55.850
Is that so?

00:24:56.090 --> 00:24:59.720
Because if you think about it calmly,
they are, without a doubt, the bad guys.

00:24:59.790 --> 00:25:00.890
Before you know it,

00:25:00.890 --> 00:25:03.420
they've created an atmosphere in
which their opponent is the bad guy.

00:25:03.430 --> 00:25:06.660
Yes, those kinds of things
happen sometimes.

00:25:06.670 --> 00:25:09.760
This type of woman
pisses me off the most!

00:25:11.240 --> 00:25:16.140
Can't Honey change into anybody? So...

00:25:17.740 --> 00:25:23.770
Are you trying to soothe your cold
heart with such nonsense, Jill-sama?

00:25:24.020 --> 00:25:27.610
Black-sama, that is inappropriate...

00:25:28.590 --> 00:25:33.120
Our omnipotent queen who give birth
to us and command us, Sister Jill.

00:25:33.130 --> 00:25:38.500
If you wish to take over everything in this
world, all you have to do is command...

00:25:38.500 --> 00:25:41.830
me, Black Claw.

00:25:43.170 --> 00:25:46.900
If it is your command, Jill-sama,
I will plunge this world

00:25:46.910 --> 00:25:50.870
into scarlet red blood
and utter darkness.

00:25:51.180 --> 00:25:57.710
And there, you can create your country,
Panther Claw's thousand year kingdom.

00:25:57.720 --> 00:26:01.740
For that goal, I am always
prepared to lay down my life.

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:07.090
Even if I am split in two,
I will never betray you.

00:26:07.090 --> 00:26:10.030
Now, command me with
but a single phrase:

00:26:10.030 --> 00:26:12.690
"Fight for me!"

00:26:13.330 --> 00:26:15.270
Black Claw.

00:26:15.900 --> 00:26:17.060
Yes.

00:26:19.640 --> 00:26:24.170
That is the kingdom you wish for. It is not what I wish for.

00:26:24.180 --> 00:26:25.580
Well...

00:26:26.180 --> 00:26:29.580
Jill-sama merely wishes to have fun...

00:26:29.580 --> 00:26:31.280
Don't butt in!

00:26:32.090 --> 00:26:33.140
Yes.

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:38.950
Are you still not going to forgive...

00:26:39.630 --> 00:26:41.030
me?

00:26:55.440 --> 00:26:58.040
They've completely occupied Shibuya.

00:27:16.500 --> 00:27:19.800
Are you not going to show up,
even after all this, Honey-san?

00:27:21.330 --> 00:27:23.700
— A woman!
— A woman is here!

00:27:24.170 --> 00:27:26.400
Who are you people?

00:27:26.410 --> 00:27:28.900
She might be Honey!

00:27:28.910 --> 00:27:31.600
Grab all the young women!

00:27:37.150 --> 00:27:40.210
— Are you okay, Na-chan?
— What are... you doing?

00:27:40.220 --> 00:27:41.520
Get on.

00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:47.380
I saw your helicopter go down.
I thought it might be you, Na-chan.

00:27:47.890 --> 00:27:50.230
Are they from Panther Claw?

00:27:50.760 --> 00:27:53.600
Nope. They're just average citizens.

00:27:54.200 --> 00:27:56.400
The hunt for Honey has begun.

00:27:56.400 --> 00:27:58.300
Exactly as they planned.

00:27:58.440 --> 00:28:01.310
What's with Honey?
Why doesn't she show up?

00:28:01.540 --> 00:28:03.370
That's what I wanted to ask you!

00:28:03.380 --> 00:28:06.900
Maybe... she doesn't
know what's going on.

00:28:18.320 --> 00:28:19.950
Honey! Are you there?

00:28:21.130 --> 00:28:22.490
Na-chan...

00:28:27.270 --> 00:28:28.390
Honey!

00:28:31.500 --> 00:28:33.560
Seiji... kun?

00:28:36.580 --> 00:28:38.740
What are you doing?!

00:28:40.110 --> 00:28:42.550
You really don't know anything?

00:28:44.620 --> 00:28:46.810
Because of me?

00:28:47.490 --> 00:28:50.350
No. It's their trap.

00:28:50.360 --> 00:28:53.350
What I said earlier... did it bother you?

00:28:53.660 --> 00:28:55.360
Huh? What?

00:28:55.360 --> 00:28:56.690
Am I wrong?

00:28:56.700 --> 00:28:59.720
I was just resting because
I was a little tired.

00:28:59.730 --> 00:29:04.190
But I didn't know things
would turn out like this, at all.

00:29:07.140 --> 00:29:10.010
Stop it! I'm not Honey!

00:29:10.010 --> 00:29:12.440
I don't care!
Shut the hell up!

00:29:12.450 --> 00:29:13.740
Stop it!

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:18.180
She's innocent! I am...

00:29:18.180 --> 00:29:20.150
I'm Cutie Honey!

00:29:20.820 --> 00:29:21.910
Honey!

00:29:22.590 --> 00:29:25.750
Honey Flash!

00:29:32.030 --> 00:29:34.860
Stop it! Let me go!

00:29:35.030 --> 00:29:37.430
You look like Honey-san.

00:29:37.440 --> 00:29:41.430
I'm not! Don't treat me
like that cosplay lady!

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:45.000
Liar. I can tell even if you've transformed.

00:29:46.410 --> 00:29:47.570
Ringo!

00:29:47.580 --> 00:29:50.310
Just tell me the truth.

00:29:50.550 --> 00:29:53.210
Stop right there, Panther Claw!

00:29:53.220 --> 00:29:54.280
Honey-san?

00:29:54.290 --> 00:29:55.910
— Is that Honey?
— What took her so long?

00:29:55.920 --> 00:29:57.690
— She's...
— Because of her!

00:30:00.760 --> 00:30:04.530
You wanted me, didn't you?
Hurry and let everyone go!

00:30:04.530 --> 00:30:07.630
I got tired of waiting, Honey-san!

00:30:25.390 --> 00:30:27.250
I can't fight here!

00:30:27.750 --> 00:30:30.020
What's wrong, Honey-san?

00:30:34.090 --> 00:30:38.760
What's wrong, Honey-san?
Make me burn up even more!

00:30:40.530 --> 00:30:42.190
What are you doing, Honey?

00:30:42.200 --> 00:30:44.600
Strange. She's not her usual self.

00:30:44.600 --> 00:30:47.330
Honey! Fight! Fight!

00:30:47.340 --> 00:30:48.900
Na... chan?

00:30:49.180 --> 00:30:52.010
Who's the person who said
that only she can fight?

00:30:52.010 --> 00:30:54.410
Being half-assed is the most shameful thing!

00:30:54.410 --> 00:30:57.210
Make sure you do what only you can do!

00:30:59.650 --> 00:31:02.210
You're right. Okay!

00:31:08.630 --> 00:31:11.150
Honey Mirage!

00:31:13.800 --> 00:31:17.070
Honey-san is flashing everywhere...
does this mean I can't catch her?!

00:31:25.010 --> 00:31:26.210
Scarlet?

00:31:26.210 --> 00:31:29.810
Cobalt, it's about time you died too.

00:31:35.560 --> 00:31:38.250
Scarlet, what are you...

00:31:38.260 --> 00:31:41.280
You see, Cobalt...
I'll tell you now...

00:31:41.290 --> 00:31:44.290
You piss me off, a lot.

00:31:44.630 --> 00:31:46.760
You've always hated me!

00:31:46.770 --> 00:31:51.360
Yes, but I've gone through the
trouble of making you die for Jill-sama,

00:31:51.370 --> 00:31:53.460
so even I have a sweet side.

00:31:53.470 --> 00:31:56.570
I won't forgive you!
I won't forgive you, Scarlet!

00:31:56.580 --> 00:32:00.410
That's no good! Direct that
hatred toward Honey-chan,

00:32:00.410 --> 00:32:04.250
since you'll become the medium connecting Jill-sama and Honey-chan with love!

00:32:04.250 --> 00:32:06.340
You bitch!

00:32:11.420 --> 00:32:15.420
Now, Jill-sama.
This is a present from Scarlet Claw!

00:32:15.430 --> 00:32:17.420
Please accept it!

00:32:19.700 --> 00:32:22.630
I feel hot! My body is heating up!

00:32:22.640 --> 00:32:25.730
Our bodies were given
to us by Jill-sama.

00:32:25.740 --> 00:32:28.870
Cobalt's ashes have once
again become Jill-sama's.

00:32:28.980 --> 00:32:32.540
Honey-chan. You'll soon
become one with Jill-sama as well.

00:32:32.550 --> 00:32:34.450
What's... going on?

00:32:34.650 --> 00:32:39.810
If the plastic DNA is altered because of the Induction System, the resulting condition is an Imaginary Format.

00:32:39.820 --> 00:32:43.480
It was in Dr. Kisaragi's research
paper, but I never thought...

00:32:44.220 --> 00:32:46.020
Explain so I can understand.

00:32:46.030 --> 00:32:50.390
Honey's heart is being eaten by Jill,
who's controlling the nanomachines!

00:32:50.530 --> 00:32:52.090
It can't be...

00:32:53.170 --> 00:32:56.900
Why?! Why is Jill-sama this happy?

00:32:56.900 --> 00:33:02.860
It seems that this time Scarlet-sama
knew what was in Jill-sama's heart.

00:33:02.880 --> 00:33:05.810
Impossible. A woman like that...

00:33:14.690 --> 00:33:15.780
Who is it?

00:33:16.120 --> 00:33:17.590
You're...

00:33:18.320 --> 00:33:20.590
You're... Sister Jill?

00:33:22.600 --> 00:33:24.830
No! Don't come in!

00:33:24.830 --> 00:33:27.160
I won't forgive you!

00:33:27.170 --> 00:33:30.070
The ones who killed my father...
Panther Claw!

00:33:32.210 --> 00:33:35.370
That's right. I will fight!

00:33:35.510 --> 00:33:38.670
Sister Jill... I'll make you disappear!

00:33:41.750 --> 00:33:45.010
Oh my. Jill-sama disappeared?

00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:47.210
What's wrong, Jill-sama?

00:33:50.060 --> 00:33:51.580
Jill-sama...

00:33:57.300 --> 00:33:59.160
What's that?

00:34:08.370 --> 00:34:10.040
What's happened to Honey?

00:34:10.040 --> 00:34:13.410
The nanomachines are multiplying.
The Ai-System is out of control.

00:34:13.410 --> 00:34:14.280
Out of control?

00:34:14.280 --> 00:34:19.080
Yes. The Ai-System substantiates
the heart... the imagination.

00:34:19.220 --> 00:34:21.740
That's Honey's will to fight.

00:34:21.750 --> 00:34:24.050
Then, was Honey's heart eaten by Jill?

00:34:24.060 --> 00:34:26.220
If that was the case,
she wouldn't be fighting Panther Claw.

00:34:26.230 --> 00:34:29.750
Honey's out of control now,
and she's become a fighting machine!

00:34:29.760 --> 00:34:31.130
Zooka!

00:34:34.530 --> 00:34:37.330
What's this? It's fun!

00:34:39.640 --> 00:34:41.070
Honey...

00:34:42.610 --> 00:34:44.870
Na-chan! Over there!

00:34:52.720 --> 00:34:54.380
Stop, Honey!

00:35:00.060 --> 00:35:02.490
— Out of the way.
— What's that?

00:35:03.800 --> 00:35:06.920
I have no choice but to destroy
an android that's out of control.

00:35:07.170 --> 00:35:08.660
Who... are you?

00:35:08.670 --> 00:35:10.830
I thought she'd do better, but...

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:14.170
— Wait a second!
— I ' m sorry, but this is part of my job.

00:35:14.170 --> 00:35:16.040
Get out of the way, Inspector Aki!

00:35:16.740 --> 00:35:19.770
Honey! Return to
your old self! Please!

00:35:19.780 --> 00:35:22.300
If you don't get out of the way,
you'll get involved too!

00:35:22.320 --> 00:35:25.720
Honey, I'm sorry! I lied to you!

00:35:27.890 --> 00:35:31.150
When I said you were
a nuisance, that was a lie!

00:35:31.160 --> 00:35:33.890
I promise I'll eat with you next time!

00:35:33.890 --> 00:35:37.260
I promise I'll eat all
the food you make!

00:35:39.700 --> 00:35:43.640
— It's no use!
— So, return to your old self! Please!

00:35:43.640 --> 00:35:45.300
We're friends, aren't we?!

00:36:06.190 --> 00:36:07.660
Oh my, my.

00:36:08.930 --> 00:36:10.160
Honey!

00:36:10.400 --> 00:36:11.830
Na-chan...

00:36:12.900 --> 00:36:14.030
Honey!

00:36:14.730 --> 00:36:19.170
Good job, Na-chan. You can do it!
Wow, amazing job!

00:36:19.170 --> 00:36:21.470
You... who are you, really?

00:36:21.470 --> 00:36:22.870
Who knows.

00:36:23.940 --> 00:36:26.940
Think of me as being her observer...

00:36:26.950 --> 00:36:28.500
An observer...

00:36:28.750 --> 00:36:32.050
and that's why you know
so much about her.

00:36:32.050 --> 00:36:33.750
Like my honesty?

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:39.450
Honey! Open your eyes! Honey!

00:36:43.560 --> 00:36:47.430
The real Honey must be
around here, Zooka!

00:37:03.880 --> 00:37:06.010
Please, Honey...

00:37:06.450 --> 00:37:08.010
open your eyes.

00:37:10.120 --> 00:37:13.490
<i>Am l really just a nuisance?</i>

00:37:17.460 --> 00:37:20.230
I'm sorry...
for saying such harsh words.

00:37:22.500 --> 00:37:24.060
You're not a nuisance.

00:37:24.300 --> 00:37:26.290
You're not a nuisance, so...!

00:37:53.370 --> 00:37:54.630
Na-chan...

00:37:55.030 --> 00:37:57.470
Honey, you woke up.

00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:01.940
Thanks. Na-chan,
your heart reached mine.

00:38:03.180 --> 00:38:04.840
Honey, um...

00:38:05.950 --> 00:38:09.380
Sea cucumber in oyster sauce...
is my favourite.

00:38:12.650 --> 00:38:16.650
Okay. I'll make it for you next time.
So eat a lot, okay?

00:38:19.430 --> 00:38:22.590
— That made me hungry.
— I knew you'd say that.

00:38:22.600 --> 00:38:24.650
Here's some rice balls and tea.

00:38:25.460 --> 00:38:26.730
When did you...?

00:38:27.030 --> 00:38:28.970
What a dangerous welcome!

00:38:28.970 --> 00:38:30.830
But anyway,
how about you get dressed?

00:38:30.840 --> 00:38:33.570
Well, I don't mind
you staying that way...

00:38:39.350 --> 00:38:40.710
What're you planning?

00:38:41.050 --> 00:38:43.680
Anti-nanomachines.
You should keep them.

00:38:43.680 --> 00:38:44.840
Me?

00:38:44.850 --> 00:38:46.910
It's effective against Panther Claw too.

00:38:46.920 --> 00:38:50.410
Also, I thinks it's better for you
to use this, if need be.

00:38:54.090 --> 00:38:56.530
The power of Love, huh?

00:38:57.860 --> 00:39:01.490
The weak electric signal that
flows through the human body,

00:39:01.500 --> 00:39:03.470
probably had an effect
on the nanomachines,

00:39:03.470 --> 00:39:07.060
and restored Honey's vital system...
is what I think, but...

00:39:07.070 --> 00:39:08.470
But what?

00:39:08.710 --> 00:39:11.610
That's why it's Love.
I mean the heart.

00:39:11.610 --> 00:39:12.740
The heart?

00:39:12.750 --> 00:39:16.550
I wonder if the mental state
had a strong effect.

00:39:17.620 --> 00:39:22.520
Back then... I felt as if
Honey's heart reached mine.

00:39:22.720 --> 00:39:24.050
Honey's heart?

00:39:24.060 --> 00:39:27.790
My heart was also sucked into Honey's.
That's what it felt like.

00:39:28.330 --> 00:39:30.850
So, she's no ordinary machine, huh?

00:39:30.860 --> 00:39:34.230
Yes, Honey isn't just
some kind of machine.

00:39:39.510 --> 00:39:42.100
You still haven't found Honey-chan?

00:39:42.110 --> 00:39:43.510
Zooka...

00:39:43.640 --> 00:39:46.700
She's got to be around here somewhere.
Make sure you find her!

00:39:46.710 --> 00:39:50.270
I'm going to take
these girls to Jill-sama.

00:39:51.150 --> 00:39:52.950
— Ringo!
— Mayumi!

00:39:57.420 --> 00:39:58.650
Who's that?

00:39:58.660 --> 00:40:01.090
Star in the heavens!
Flower on the earth!

00:40:01.090 --> 00:40:02.560
Love to the people!

00:40:02.560 --> 00:40:05.360
Warrior of Love, Cutie Honey!

00:40:05.500 --> 00:40:08.930
It's scripted that we have to ask her,
even if we already know...

00:40:08.930 --> 00:40:11.770
But I'm happy you
showed up, Honey-chan.

00:40:11.800 --> 00:40:13.500
I was about to get bored.

00:40:13.510 --> 00:40:15.870
I won't give you
the chance to be bored!

00:40:15.880 --> 00:40:17.840
Honey Typhoon!

00:40:29.220 --> 00:40:31.020
Ba-ba-ba-ba-bam!

00:40:34.330 --> 00:40:36.850
Sky-sky-ky!

00:40:39.800 --> 00:40:40.890
Fly!

00:40:43.700 --> 00:40:47.830
Could it be... honey's trying to fight
in an area that won't be damaged?

00:40:48.170 --> 00:40:51.140
Honey's thinking straight, isn't she?

00:40:59.520 --> 00:41:01.750
Don't get cocky!

00:41:07.060 --> 00:41:10.030
Scarlet Beam!

00:41:19.810 --> 00:41:22.070
— Tank Panther.
— Transform!

00:41:22.070 --> 00:41:23.410
Ba-ba-ba-ba-ba-bam!

00:41:23.410 --> 00:41:25.470
Honey Shining!

00:41:29.080 --> 00:41:30.210
Amazing!

00:41:30.220 --> 00:41:32.710
Honey's strength is awakening.

00:41:34.020 --> 00:41:37.250
Wa...wait! In my, Bazooka Panther's,
body is a time bomb...

00:41:37.260 --> 00:41:40.380
...is what I was about to say... Zooka!

00:41:42.660 --> 00:41:45.820
How dare you embarrass me!

00:41:45.830 --> 00:41:47.630
I won't...

00:41:47.630 --> 00:41:49.330
forgive you!

00:41:53.770 --> 00:41:55.600
Enough acting strong!

00:41:55.610 --> 00:41:57.700
Lightning Lancer!

00:41:59.010 --> 00:42:00.770
This is the end!

00:42:04.920 --> 00:42:08.180
Honey! She's planning
to go into your heart again!

00:42:08.190 --> 00:42:09.480
I know!

00:42:09.490 --> 00:42:11.580
If you know, then what?

00:42:11.620 --> 00:42:14.460
You can't escape from
the nanomachine ashes!

00:42:14.460 --> 00:42:16.490
I wonder!

00:42:17.860 --> 00:42:19.460
They're disappearing?

00:42:19.470 --> 00:42:22.830
Let me explain! The Lightning Lancer's
Super Vibrating Shock Waves

00:42:22.840 --> 00:42:25.500
disintegrate the
nanomachines in 0.1 seconds,

00:42:25.500 --> 00:42:28.100
thus completely destroying them!

00:42:35.010 --> 00:42:38.210
That narration... You were
telling the truth, weren't you?

00:42:38.250 --> 00:42:40.340
Who knows...

00:42:43.990 --> 00:42:45.290
Honey!

00:42:45.590 --> 00:42:46.990
Na-chan!

00:42:47.530 --> 00:42:48.930
You did it, Honey.

00:42:48.930 --> 00:42:51.450
It's all thanks to
Na-chan for saving me.

00:42:52.030 --> 00:42:53.730
The radio waves are back

00:42:53.730 --> 00:42:57.130
at just the right moment. The incident is over.
Send the police.

00:42:57.170 --> 00:42:58.400
Huh? What?

00:42:58.400 --> 00:43:01.340
They disappeared!
The women and the cages...

00:43:01.340 --> 00:43:02.670
What happened?

00:43:02.680 --> 00:43:04.370
That's not all!

00:43:04.380 --> 00:43:07.970
There have been kidnappings of
women all throughout the province!

00:43:07.980 --> 00:43:09.350
What did you say?

00:43:12.790 --> 00:43:14.840
We don't need Honey...

00:43:14.850 --> 00:43:19.650
I, Black Claw, will become
Jill-sama's seed of happiness.

00:43:23.300 --> 00:43:25.290
What's... that?

00:43:25.970 --> 00:43:27.360
It's Jill.

00:43:27.470 --> 00:43:30.200
Sister Jill is... in there!

00:43:35.630 --> 00:43:40.220
Episode 2: Earth

00:43:40.380 --> 00:43:43.850
The End.

00:43:43.880 --> 00:43:45.610
Into your heart!

00:43:51.320 --> 00:43:53.190
Broken my heart!

00:43:58.700 --> 00:44:00.720
Into your heart!

00:44:07.840 --> 00:44:12.280
On a sleepless night, in my heart,
Nemure nai yoru mune no naka de

00:44:12.280 --> 00:44:15.940
my shaking heart beat,
Yureteru kodou ga

00:44:15.950 --> 00:44:19.710
As if harshly engraving a rhythm,
Hageshiku rythm kizamu youni

00:44:19.720 --> 00:44:23.420
Started to throb violently.
Takanari hajimeta no

00:44:23.420 --> 00:44:24.720
Into your heart!

00:44:24.720 --> 00:44:31.360
I've always been able to hear your voice.
Itsumo kikoeru anata no koe

00:44:32.160 --> 00:44:36.330
I don't want this to change.
Kono mama itsumade mo

00:44:36.370 --> 00:44:41.640
Please let me continue to hear it by your side!
Soba de kikitsuzuketai

00:44:41.940 --> 00:44:46.930
You and l. Please don't change!
You and I. Kawaranaide zutto

00:44:47.050 --> 00:44:52.610
Live on just the way you are,
Aruga mama ni ikite yukeru

00:44:52.620 --> 00:44:57.080
If you stay.
Anata ga soko ni

00:44:57.090 --> 00:45:02.220
For your love! There for me,
For your love! Ite kureta nara

00:45:02.230 --> 00:45:07.100
I can walk
Doko made mo aruite!

00:45:07.100 --> 00:45:11.830
Anywhere!
Yukeru yo

00:45:13.440 --> 00:45:15.410
Into your heart!

00:45:21.910 --> 00:45:25.850
Honey's anger defeats Black Claw,
one of the Four Gods.

00:45:25.850 --> 00:45:28.340
But Honey is exhausted due
to her emotional distress,

00:45:28.350 --> 00:45:30.450
and her body is absorbed by Jill.

00:45:30.460 --> 00:45:33.820
Jill then begins to fuse with
the world, becoming Jill Three.

00:45:34.060 --> 00:45:37.090
Natsuko's cry shakes Honey's soul.

00:45:37.100 --> 00:45:39.860
What destiny awaits Honey?

00:45:40.030 --> 00:45:42.630
Next episode of Re: Cutie Honey – Episode 3: Humans.

00:45:42.630 --> 00:45:45.000
Please look forward to it!
